{"abstract":"Ergoterapeutuddannelsen i University College Lillebælt(UCL) har i 2013 modtaget en bevilling fra Statens Center for Kompetenceudvikling (SCK) og har igangsat et aktionslæringsprojekt, der har fokus på udvikling af princeipper, metoder og redskaber til uddannelsesdifferentiering. Projektet, der implementeres i peridoen 2013-2015, danner rammen om nærværende artikel. Artiklen er således udarbejdet på baggrund af de foreløbige resultater.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Madsen, Anette Judithe","Rasmussen, Jette","Ulstrup, Eva","Bollerup-Jensen, Thea"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-648671"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Undervisningsdifferentiering"],"level":"sci","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-UC-UCL"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"undervisningsdifferentiering i professionsuddannelserne","src":["ucl"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCL"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.ucl.dk/ws/files/29516579/Uddannelsesnyt_06.02.15.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-648671","ids":["ucl-9e9a3ef2-0286-4ce2-9efa-1c5ba35cc39f"],"keyword":["undervisningsdifferentiering"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-5A2278E55CF5B28266F796E1ABBA72E6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.ucl.dk/ws/files/29516579/Uddannelsesnyt_06.02.15.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucl university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCL","l3nl":"UCL University College","l3nn":"UCL University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCL University College","namevar":["UCL Erhvervsakademi og Professionshøjskole, Direktion, Sundhed, Ergoterapeutuddannelsen"],"n